      "patch_payload": {
        "candidate_id": "C_9df3452d21175c15_2",
        "edit": "Fix the 7-segment decode table: the case for 4'b1101 was incorrectly assigned 7'b1111001 (which is the code for digit 9 / 4'b1110). Correct 4'b1101 to 7'b1011110 and add the missing 4'b1110 entry with 7'b1111001, so cycle13 (a=1101) yields 1011110 as expected.",
